  "question": {
    "html": "<p>When heating a metal rod at one end, thermal energy is transferred along the rod.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which statement explains this transfer?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Free electrons transfer kinetic energy to the ions in the metal</li><li data-label=\"B\">Intermolecular potential energy increases throughout the metal</li><li data-label=\"C\">Intermolecular potential energy is transferred to kinetic energy</li><li data-label=\"D\">Ions in the metal radiate energy in all directions</li></ol>"
  },
